  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and garlic. Pick and thinly slice mint leaves.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, mint and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c3bb006f7d3d646b76a41d/step-cbf7a002.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 3-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and chickpeas and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk, vegetable stock powder and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat. Stir in the butter until melted, then lightly mash chickpeas. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c3bb006f7d3d646b76a41d/step-131601d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the filling is cooking, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add mixed salad leaves and cucumber. Toss to coat.\n• Just before serving, microwave the mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c3bb006f7d3d646b76a41d/step-707ed4a4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill tortillas with a helping of salad and chermoula chickpeas.\n• Drizzle with mint yoghurt and sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61c3bb006f7d3d646b76a41d/step-0c66a75e.jpg"
    }
  ]
